message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "TMMDN: Temporal Multivariate Mixture Density Network (ALSTM-TTM)"
abstract: >-
  Network architecture of the ALSTM-TTM model: an attention-LSTM encoder feeding a
  two-component multivariate Student's t mixture density output layer. Market data,
  trained models, data preprocessing, the training pipeline and the portfolio
  strategies of the paper are not included.
